                                "sense_id": "27df930a-5f6b-3886-b81b-b45467ffb4fb",
                                "text": "Some researchers have proposed that early social dysfunction in 22q11DS is associated with premorbidity to schizophrenia, and that these social impairments may result in a misdiagnosis of an ASD."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fb30810-c8ab-4a79-a711-61105dc1f652",
                                "sense_id": "27df930a-5f6b-3886-b81b-b45467ffb4fb",
                                "text": "They have suffered from misdiagnoses, lapses in treatment, a lack of access to specialized food and physical therapy, displacement and the unrelenting stress of war."
                            }
                        ]
